##  Model Info

| Property   | Value                          |
|------------|--------------------------------|
| Dataset    | Iris (sklearn built-in)        |
| Algorithm  | RandomForestClassifier         |
| Accuracy   | 100% on test split             |
| Classes    | setosa, versicolor, virginica  |
| Features   | sepal/petal length & width     |
